SUMMARY:Pisgah Brewing Upcoming Music Lineup
DESCRIPTION:June is heating up in Black Mountain! Here is the full Pisgah Brewing live music calendar for the month. \n\n\n\nBric’s Dip & Roll will be open Wednesday-Sunday from 4-10pm at the taproom! Be sure to come hungry\, thirsty and ready rock!\n\n\n\n\n\nTrivia is hosted on Wednesdays at 6pm by DumbAshe Trivia.\n\n\nFounded in 2005\, Pisgah is known for producing some of the most sought after craft ales in Western North Carolina. Pisgah Brewing Company currently operates an indoor taproom and an open air outdoor bar in the summer and fall months with live music several days a week. Check out our upcoming schedule at pisgahbrewing.com/events
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/pisgah-brewing-spring-calendar-2-2-2-2-2/2026-06-10/
LOCATION:Pisgah Brewing Company Black Mountain\, 2948 US-70\, Black Mountain\, NC\, 28711
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Black Mountain,Live Music
